 "provenance": "Bavaria 11 (secret stage, world 1 level 10): secret exit 32,20 from the spawn, control-only on the exact S700 core, no damage, no deaths, no resets. Start values: weaponTier 2 (hook from the Bavaria 3 chest; Bavaria secret stages are reached after Bavaria 8), maxHealth 4 (no armor), lives 12 (campaign value used by the old routes), diamonds/redDiamonds 0 (per-stage HUD, unused), diving true (diving item from the Bavaria 8 chest; required to swim in the flooded well). Route: hammer the brick column 17,2-6 (it crumbles, its stones and mine roll out), hook the mine down via 15,8 so it falls in column 13 and explodes beside rubble 14,13 (right pool drains into the lower well); once the water settles hammer the bridge switch 11,12 (bridge 6,6 opens); in the left pocket hook stone 5,4 down to 4,6 as a cushion and lower mine 6,4 onto it (4,5), then move the stone to 7,8 and the mine onto the bridge 6,6; hook the mine to 7,6: it lands on the stone and rolls into column 8 where the hero catches it on his head (a mine landing on the hero resets its fall count) and lowers it to 8,10; hook it into column 9: it explodes at 9,13 and removes rubble 8,13 (left pool drains, the well fills up to row 18); swim and push the floating stone 12,20 along row 18 onto plate 15,18 (gate 17,17 stays open); collect the 23 pit diamonds, checkpoint 2 at 27,17; in the right room hook stone 21,5 to 25,10 and mine 21,7 to 24,8, hook the mine to 25,8 so it rolls off the stone into column 26 where the hero catches it and lowers it to 26,12; hook it into column 27: it explodes at 27,15 and removes rubble 26,15; take the gold key from chest 24,15, open gold lock 28,19 (gate 28,20) and walk to the secret exit. The magic diamond lock recorded at 29,20 (25 diamonds) leaves tile -1 in this map and does not block.",
